WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.960
Reading every book about flying a plane
gives you potential.

00:00:03.960 --> 00:00:09.160
Stepping into the cockpit, taking the
controls, and navigating real challenges,

00:00:09.160 --> 00:00:12.080
that is how you build proven ability.

00:00:12.080 --> 00:00:17.240
At EPOCHA, we bridge the gap between
classroom theory and career reality.

00:00:17.240 --> 00:00:21.560
We provide youth aged 14 to 29
with the hands-on coaching,

00:00:21.560 --> 00:00:26.520
work-based learning and guidance they need
to launch their future with confidence.

00:00:27.250 --> 00:00:30.100 line:80%
EPOCHA
Ending youth unemployment before it starts.
